        <KEYWORD>var</KEYWORD> dict: [<TYPE>String</TYPE>: <TYPE>Int</TYPE>] <OPERATOR>=</OPERATOR> [<STRING>"one"</STRING>: <NUMBER>1</NUMBER>, <STRING>"two"</STRING>: <NUMBER>2</NUMBER>]

        <COMMENT>// Control flow</COMMENT>
        <KEYWORD>if</KEYWORD> count <OPERATOR>&gt;</OPERATOR> <NUMBER>0</NUMBER> {
